<!-- The Headless raster backend: gl00_{r,o,d}.dll, selected by
     [ClientGraphics] rasterMajor=0, which SetupClientGraphics uses as the
     console default. The source has been in the tree for years with no project
     file, so that config value has always named a DLL that did not exist.

     Two reasons this project matters beyond fixing that. It is the second
     implementation of Gl_api, so a change to the contract is compile-checked
     against something other than the backend making the change. And it contains
     no DirectX of any kind, which makes it the DX-free baseline for the
     measurement harness.

     Authored fresh, deliberately not cloned from a DX9 project: this must not
     acquire a legacy DirectX include or library path, and it links no graphics
     API at all.

     Output naming and all intermediate paths belong to Directory.Build.props
     and Directory.Build.targets at the repository root.

     x64 only. The three Win32 solution configurations skip this project. -->
